              "text": "115-1 國立中興大學勤學獎助學金申請表-A Underprivileged Diligent Student Scholarship and Financial Aid Application Form-A (115-1) 姓名：Name E-mail： 學號：Student ID □研究所Master's Program Institute of 所 年級 Grade 手機：Phone Number □大學部Bachelor's Degree Department of 系 年級Grade 申請資格 Eligibility Requirements： □最新 3 個月內全戶戶籍資料 Household Registration Data for the Entire Household within the Last 3 Months □家境清寒證明或學雜費減免資格 Proof of Financial Need or Eligibility for Tuition and Fees Reduction □大學部成績：前學期學業成績班上前 50%以內；操行成績平均 85 分以上。Bachelor's degree Performance: Academic performance in the previous semester should be within the top 50% of the class; Conduct grade should average 85 or higher. □研究所成績 ： 前學期學業成績平均80 分以上 ； 操行成績平均85 分以上 。Master's Program Performance: Academic performance in the previous semester should have an average of 80 or higher; conduct score should average 85 or higher. 新生及轉學生用前畢業學校或同等學歷平均成績申請。New and Transfer Students should apply using the average grades from their previous school or equivalent educational background. □最新全戶所得清單證明(114 年度家庭總收入≦90 萬元且利息≦5000 元) Latest Household Income Statement as Proof (Total Household Income for the Year 2025 AD) ≦ NT$900,000 , and interest ≦ NT$5,000) □最新全戶財產清單證明(114 年度家庭總財產 300 萬元以下且車輛數量≦1) Latest Household Asset Inventory as Proof (Total household assets of less than NT$3,000,000 for the year, and number of vehicles≦1) □11 4 學 年 享有學雜費減免≦2 萬元 或 □超過 2 萬元,不得申請 (統計至收件截止日) Eligible for tuition and fee reduction for the academic year 114: □≦ NT$20,000 114-2 學期 Academic Year 114, 2nd Semester 成績 Grades 班上成績排名 Class Ranking 操行≧85 Conduct Performance ≧ 85 班排名 Class Rank／班上人數 Total Number of Students in Class % 家庭年收入(含利息) ≦90 萬元：________________元 Household Annual Income (Including Interest): NT: _ 利息金額≦5000 元：________________元 Interest Amount: NT: ____________ 家庭財產總額 300 萬元以下：____________________元 Total Household Assets: NT$ ____________ 車 輛 數量≦1：________________輛 Number of vehicles: __________ 曾有操行上的不良紀錄：□是 □否 Any Misconduct Records: □ Yes □ No 請自我檢核是否符合申請資格： 簽 名 Please Self-Check for Eligibility: Signature 本人保證上述申請表資料與相關證明文件屬實且無遺漏，若有偽造不實與遺漏情事， 願負法律 責任並繳回本獎 助學金。已明瞭本校最新版本個資隱私權政策聲明與個人資料當事人權利聲 明，同意本校使用其申請資料於獎助學金與相關業務，且概不退件。若其他獎助學金有規定不 得兼領其他獎助學金，同意領取先通知得獎者之獎助學金，放棄選擇權與不兼領獎助學金。 I hereby certify that the information provided in this application form and the related documents are true and complete. I am willing to bear legal responsibility and return the scholarship if any information is found to be false or incomplete. I have read and understood the latest version of the University's Privacy Policy Statement and the Data Subject Rights Statement. I agree to the University's use of the application data for scholarship -related matters, and I understand that the application materials will not be returned. If other scholarships or grants stipulate that concurrent awards are not allowed, I agree to accept the scholarship that is first notified, waiving the right to choose or receive multiple scholarships. 申請者簽章：_ Signature ________申請日期： ____年____月___日 Application Date: mm/dd/yyyy"
