              "text": "陳守先生紀念獎助學金申請表 Mr. Chen Shou Memorial Scholarship Application Form 申請日期 Application Date： 年 月 日 (Year/Month/Day) 學院別 College： 學號 Student ID： 系所 Department： 年級 Grade： 姓名 Name： 手機 Mobile Phone No.： 申請 資格 (請勾選) Eligibility (Please Check) □低收入戶 Low-income families □中 低收入戶 Medium low-income families □ 特殊境遇家庭子女或孫子女 Child or Grandchild of Special Circumstances Family □ 身心障礙學生或身心障礙人士子女 Students with physical/mental disabilities and children of persons with physical/mental disabilities. □原住民學生 Indigenous Student 以上申請者需符合本學期學雜費減免資格，並在本學期有辦理學雜費減免 Applicants must meet the eligibility criteria for tuition fee reductions this semester and have applied for tuition fee reductions for this semester. □獲教育部弱勢助學金計畫補助之學生(符合本學年度弱勢助學金申請資 格)Students receiving disadvantage grants from the Ministry of Education program (meeting the eligibility criteria for this academic year's disadvantaged student aid) □家庭突遭變故且家庭年所得總額114萬元以下經學校審核通過者。 Students whose families have experienced sudden changes and have a total annual income of less than 1.14 million NT dollars as verified by the school. 繳交文件 document： □前一學期學業與操行成績單，轉學生用前學校成績申請。 Academic and behavioral transcripts of the previous semester. Transfer students can apply with their previous school transcripts. □ 高教深耕課程10小時證明。 Proof of Attendance for at least 10 hours of participation in higher education deep cultivation counseling activities. 114學年度 第1學期 114th Academic Year, 1st Semester 成績 Grades 操行 Conduct 班上排名(%)Class Ranking (%) % 已明瞭本校最新版本個資隱私權政策聲明與個人資料當事人權利聲明，同意本校使 用其申請相關資料 於獎助學金相關業務，且概不退件。 若其他獎學金有規定不得兼領其他獎助學金，同意領取先通知或 先核定得獎之獎學金，放棄選擇權與不兼領獎學金。 I have read and understood the latest version of the University's Privacy Policy Statement and the Data Subject Rights Statement. I agree t o the University's use of the application-related data for scholarship -related matters. I understand that the application materials will not be returned. If other scholarships stipulate that concur rent awards are not allowed, I agree to accep t the scholarship that is first notified or approved, waiving the right to choose or receive multiple scholarships. 簽名 Signature：_______________________ 備註 Notes 一、收件期間：115年5月4日至5月15日17時止。 Submission Period: 05/04~05/15, 5:00 PM 二、檢附前學期成績單(含班上名次)。 Attach the transcript of the previous semester (including class ranking)."
