              "text": "國立中興大學 115 學年度「麗裕慈善基金會獎學金」申請表 Application Form for the \"Li Yu Charity Foundation Scholarship\" for the 115 Academic Year 姓名 Name 學號 Student ID 電話 Phone NO. 系級 Department and Grade E-mail 申 請 條 件 Eligibility Criteria □1.遵行孝道 、 實踐孝悌。Demonstrates filial piety and actively practices familial respect and duty. □2.需照顧父母、長輩或家人起居生活。 Responsible for caring for parents, elders, or family members in daily life. □3.需幫忙維持家計，事蹟確實者。 Assists in supporting the household financially, with verifiable records. □4.其他有具體文件足資證明其確有堪為楷模之孝行事蹟者。 Other notable acts of filial piety, substantiated with supporting documents. 孝行事蹟（由學生本人親自填寫並提供證明文件） Acts of Filial Piety (To be personally completed by the student and accompanied by supporting documents) 本人以上所陳述事情一切屬實，如有不實或不符規定等情事，經查證屬實者，願被撤銷資格，絕無異 議。本人已明瞭本校最新版本個資隱私權政策聲明與當事人權利聲明，同意本校使用其申請相關資料 於相關業務，且概不退件。若其他獎學金有規定不得兼領其他獎助學金，同意領取先通知得獎者之獎 助學金，放棄選擇權與不兼領獎助學金。I hereby certify that all the information provided above is true and accurate. If any false statements or violations of the regulations are found upon verification, I agree to have my qualification revoked without objection.I have read and understood the latest version of the university’ s Personal Data Privacy Policy Statement and Rights of the Data Subject Statement. I consent to the university using my application-related information for relevant administrative purposes, and I acknowledge that submitted documents will not be returned. If other scholarships prohibit recipients from receiving multiple scholarships simultaneously , I agree to notify the awarding institution of my decision and waive my right to select or retain multiple scholarships. 申請人簽章： ( Applicant's Signature) 推薦師長 Recommending Faculty 簽 章 Signature 系主任 Department Chair 簽 章 Signature 註：本表如不敷使用，請自行增加頁面。Note: If the space provided in this form is insufficient, please attach additional pages as needed."
            }
